---
const marqueeTopics = [
  'ADVOGADOS',
  'MÉDICOS',
  'NUTRICIONISTAS',
  'PSICÓLOGOS',
  'ARQUITETOS',
  'CONTADORES',
  'CONSULTORES',
  'COACHES',
]
const marqueeItems = [...marqueeTopics, ...marqueeTopics]
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>One Impact | Início (teste)</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zalando+Sans+Expanded:wght@600;700&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('reveal-ready')</script>

    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }

      body {
        background-color: #0D0A1A;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
      }

      .reveal-ready [data-reveal] .reveal-item {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translate3d(0, 24px, 0);
        transition:
          opacity 0.65s ease,
          transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }

      .reveal-ready [data-reveal] .reveal-item:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 80ms; }
      .reveal-ready [data-reveal] .reveal-item:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 160ms; }
      .reveal-ready [data-reveal] .reveal-item:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 240ms; }

      .reveal-ready [data-reveal].is-visible .reveal-item {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      }

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100svh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-start;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 72px 20px 40px;
      }

      /* Imagem do celular — fundo do hero */
      .hero-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background: #0D0A1A url('/hero-teste-celular-8.webp') center bottom / cover no-repeat;
      }

      .hero > .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 8px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .title {
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.12;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        max-width: 820px;
      }

      .title-highlight {
        color: #9774FE;
      }

      .description {
        max-width: 500px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 8px;
        padding: 14px 48px;
        border: 1px solid #9774FE;
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #9774FE, #7446FD, #9774FE);
        background-size: 300% 100%;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.35);
        animation: shimmer-purple 4s linear infinite;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 13px 32px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.48);
      }

      @keyframes shimmer-purple {
        0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        100% { background-position: 300% 50%; }
      }

      /* Malha de pontos — bolinhas bem pequenas, textura sutil (acima dos cards) */
      .hero-dots {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 1;
        pointer-events: none;
        background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.35) 0.8px, transparent 0.8px);
        background-size: 12px 12px;
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 75% at 50% 45%, black, transparent 85%);
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 75% at 50% 45%, black, transparent 85%);
      }

      /* Menu flutuante — só aparece depois da seção de dados */
      .floating-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 16px;
        left: 16px;
        right: 16px;
        z-index: 100;
        min-height: 44px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 5px 5px 5px 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
        border-radius: 9999px;
        background: rgba(247, 245, 253, 0.78);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.16);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        pointer-events: none;
        transform: translateY(-16px);
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
      }

      .floating-header.is-shown {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        pointer-events: auto;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #130F26;
      }

      .brand > strong {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .header-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .desktop-menu {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2px;
      }

      .desktop-menu a {
        padding: 8px 11px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #130F26;
        transition: color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
      }

      .desktop-menu a:hover {
        color: #7345FD;
        background: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.09);
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        display: inline-flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 5px;
        padding: 0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.12);
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.06);
        box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.08);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle > span {
        width: 18px;
        height: 1.5px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        background: #130F26;
        transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle:hover,
      .mobile-menu-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] {
        border-color: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.2);
        background: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.1);
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] > span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(6.5px) rotate(45deg);
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] > span:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      .mobile-menu-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] > span:nth-child(3) {
        transform: translateY(-6.5px) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 10px);
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        padding: 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: rgba(247, 245, 253, 0.94);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.22);
        backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        pointer-events: none;
        transform: translateY(-8px) scale(0.98);
        transform-origin: top center;
        transition: opacity 0.22s ease, visibility 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
      }

      .mobile-menu.is-open {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        pointer-events: auto;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }

      .mobile-menu a {
        padding: 13px 16px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #130F26;
        transition: color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
      }

      .mobile-menu a:hover,
      .mobile-menu a:focus-visible {
        color: #7345FD;
        background: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.09);
        outline: none;
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .desktop-menu {
          display: flex;
        }

        .mobile-menu-toggle,
        .mobile-menu {
          display: none;
        }
      }

      /* Marquee — áreas atendidas */
      .marquee-section {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 17px 0;
        background: #130F26;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.16);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.16);
      }

      .marquee-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
        mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
      }

      .marquee-track {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
        animation: marquee-scroll 30s linear infinite;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        padding-right: 2.5rem;
      }

      .marquee-track:hover {
        animation-play-state: paused;
      }

      .marquee-item {
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      }

      .marquee-separator {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #9774FE;
        opacity: 0.7;
      }

      @keyframes marquee-scroll {
        from { transform: translateX(0); }
        to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
      }

      /* Reveal reversível — aparece ao entrar na tela, some ao sair */
      .reveal-ready [data-reveal-scroll] .reveal-fade {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translate3d(0, 24px, 0);
        transition:
          opacity 0.65s ease,
          transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }

      .reveal-ready [data-reveal-scroll] .reveal-fade:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 80ms; }
      .reveal-ready [data-reveal-scroll] .reveal-fade:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 160ms; }
      .reveal-ready [data-reveal-scroll] .reveal-fade:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 240ms; }

      .reveal-ready [data-reveal-scroll].is-visible .reveal-fade {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      }

      /* Seção Dados — número-herói + barras horizontais */
      .dados-section {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 88px 20px;
        background: #130F26;
      }

      .dados-dots {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.35) 0.8px, transparent 0.8px);
        background-size: 12px 12px;
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 75% at 50% 45%, black, transparent 85%);
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 75% at 50% 45%, black, transparent 85%);
      }

      .dados-container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1140px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .dados-container h2 {
        margin: 0 0 40px;
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }

      .dados-grid {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 32px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .stat-hero-value {
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 72px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7345FD, #9774FE, #E9E1FF, #9774FE, #7345FD);
        background-size: 300% 100%;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: shimmer-purple 4s linear infinite;
      }

      .stat-hero-label {
        max-width: 380px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      }

      .stat-cols-wrap {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
      }

      /* Gráfico de colunas — cresce de baixo quando a seção aparece */
      .stat-cols {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 36px;
      }

      .stat-col {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        width: 110px;
      }

      .stat-col-track {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 220px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .stat-col-fill {
        position: relative;
        width: 64px;
        height: 0;
        border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9774FE, #7345FD 60%, #4B2FBE);
        box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.35);
        transition: height 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }

      .is-visible .stat-col-fill {
        height: var(--val);
      }

      .stat-col-value {
        position: absolute;
        top: -30px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.4s ease 0.7s;
      }

      .is-visible .stat-col-value {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .stat-col-label {
        min-height: 42px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 11px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      @media (max-width: 899px) {
        .stat-cols {
          gap: 14px;
        }

        .stat-col {
          width: 96px;
        }

        .stat-col-track {
          height: 170px;
        }

        .stat-col-fill {
          width: 48px;
        }

        .stat-col-value {
          font-size: 14px;
          top: -24px;
        }

        .stat-col-label {
          font-size: 9px;
        }
      }

      .dados-fonte {
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 10px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .dados-grid {
          flex-direction: row;
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 72px;
          align-items: center;
        }

        .stat-hero {
          text-align: left;
        }

        .stat-hero-value {
          font-size: 96px;
        }
      }

      /* Seção 3 — visual da hero antiga (fundo claro, glow, órbitas e malha) */
      .cta-section {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 90vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 88px 20px;
        background: #F7F5FD;
      }

      .cta-glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 62% 46% at 50% 28%, rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.13), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 34% at 12% 88%, rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.10), transparent 72%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 34% at 88% 86%, rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.10), transparent 72%);
      }

      .orbit-layer {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        border-radius: 50%;
        animation: orbit-spin 46s linear infinite;
      }

      .orbit-layer-inner {
        inset: 17%;
        animation-duration: 30s;
        animation-direction: reverse;
      }

      .orbit-layer::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -4px;
        left: 50%;
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #7345FD;
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.65);
      }

      @keyframes orbit-spin {
        from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
        to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
      }

      .cta-dots {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.40) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
        background-size: 22px 22px;
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 32%, black, transparent 75%);
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 32%, black, transparent 75%);
      }

      .cta-section > .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      /* Cards de tópicos — por que presença profissional importa */
      .cta-cards {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1140px;
        margin: 20px 0 8px;
      }

      .cta-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 24px 20px;
        text-align: left;
        border: 1px solid rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.08);
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.08);
        transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
      }

      .cta-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        border-color: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 44px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.16);
      }

      .cta-card-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.28);
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.1);
        color: #7345FD;
      }

      .cta-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #130F26;
      }

      .cta-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.75);
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .cta-cards {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
          gap: 20px;
        }

        .cta-card {
          padding: 28px 24px;
        }
      }

      .cta-section .badge {
        border-color: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.15);
        background: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.05);
        color: rgba(19, 15, 38, 0.75);
      }

      .cta-section .title {
        color: #130F26;
      }

      .cta-section .description {
        color: #4F4F57;
      }

      /* Seção 4 — cases da One Impact (mesmo padrão da pagina-v2) */
      .cases-section {
        padding: 88px 20px;
        background: #130F26;
      }

      .cases-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1140px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .cases-container h2 {
        margin: 0 0 40px;
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }

      /* Scroll-stacking — cada case empilha por cima do anterior (ref: Card Stacking, animacoes e efeitos.md) */
      .cases-stack {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .stack-card {
        position: relative;
        position: sticky;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-align: left;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.28);
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #232035, #16112B);
        box-shadow: 0 -16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.12);
      }

      /* Linha gradiente no topo do card */
      .stack-card::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 2px;
        z-index: 1;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4B2FBE, #9774FE, #D9CCFF, #9774FE, #4B2FBE);
      }

      /* Moldura de navegador na imagem */
      .stack-card-media {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        background: #232035;
      }

      .stack-card-browserbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 5px;
        height: 26px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        padding: 0 12px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .stack-card-browserbar span {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.45);
      }

      .stack-card-media .case-card-image {
        flex: 1;
      }

      .stack-card:nth-child(1) { top: 84px; }
      .stack-card:nth-child(2) { top: 100px; }
      .stack-card:nth-child(3) { top: 116px; }

      .case-card-image {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 1376 / 700;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4B2FBE, #7345FD 55%, #9774FE);
      }

      .case-card-image-casa3 {
        background: #F5F0EC url('/case-casa3-arquitetura.webp') center top / cover no-repeat;
      }

      .case-card-image-fogaca {
        background: #1B2232 url('/case-jorge-fogaca.webp') center top / cover no-repeat;
      }

      .case-card-image-katiuscia {
        background: #E9ECE7 url('/case-katiuscia-souza.webp') center top / cover no-repeat;
      }

      .case-card-body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .case-card-tag {
        display: inline-flex;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.32);
        background: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.14);
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 8px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #9774FE;
      }

      .stack-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }

      .stack-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      .case-card-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: auto;
        padding-top: 8px;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #9774FE;
        transition: gap 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .case-card-link:hover {
        gap: 10px;
        color: #C9BBFF;
      }

      .cases-more-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.5);
        background: transparent;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .cases-more-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.14);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.25);
      }

      /* Desktop: imagem e texto lado a lado dentro do card empilhado */
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .stack-card {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
          align-items: stretch;
        }

        .stack-card-media {
          height: 100%;
        }

        .stack-card .case-card-image {
          height: 100%;
          aspect-ratio: auto;
          min-height: 380px;
        }

        .stack-card .case-card-body {
          justify-content: center;
          padding: 48px;
          gap: 14px;
        }

        .stack-card .case-card h3,
        .stack-card h3 {
          font-size: 24px;
        }
      }

      /* Seção final — CTA escuro com círculos e orbs (visual da hero antiga) */
      .final-section {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 90vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 88px 20px;
        background: #130F26;
      }

      .final-glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 50% 50%, rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.2), transparent 70%);
      }

      .final-circles {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 0;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        width: min(640px, 88vw);
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.28);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .final-circles::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 17%;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.36);
      }

      .final-circles::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: -22%;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.18);
      }

      .final-section > .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      /* Rodapé corporativo */
      .footer {
        background: #0D0A1A;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(115, 69, 253, 0.16);
        padding: 56px 20px 0;
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
      }

      .footer-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1140px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 36px;
      }

      .footer-col h4 {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }

      .footer-brand strong {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }

      .footer-brand p {
        margin: 10px 0 0;
        max-width: 280px;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      }

      .footer-col ul {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .footer-col a {
        font-size: 13px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .footer-col a:hover {
        color: #9774FE;
      }

      .footer-bottom {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 20px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .footer-bottom span {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .footer-grid {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
          gap: 40px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 899px) {
        .footer-grid {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 32px;
        }
      }

      /* Bolinhas de vidro com ícone — flutuando ao lado do celular */
      .hero-orbs {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .glass-orb {
        position: absolute;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 60%);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        color: #9774FE;
        animation: orb-float 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      }

      .glass-orb-1 { top: 62%; left: 19%; animation-delay: -1s; }
      .glass-orb-2 { top: 52%; right: 16%; animation-delay: -3s; }

      @keyframes orb-float {
        from { transform: translateY(0); }
        to { transform: translateY(-12px); }
      }

      @media (max-width: 899px) {
        .glass-orb {
          width: 48px;
          height: 48px;
        }

        .glass-orb svg {
          width: 20px;
          height: 20px;
        }

        .glass-orb-1 { top: 58%; left: 20px; }
        .glass-orb-2 { top: 68%; right: 20px; }
      }

      /* Box de gráfico — vendas com área e ponto destacado */
      .glass-chart {
        position: absolute;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2px;
        width: 185px;
        padding: 11px 12px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        text-align: left;
        animation: orb-float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        animation-delay: -2s;
        top: 30%;
        left: 8%;
      }

      .glass-chart-label {
        font-size: 9px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      .glass-chart-value {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-family: 'Zalando Sans Expanded', sans-serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .glass-chart-arrow {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #9774FE;
      }

      .glass-chart svg {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
      }

      @media (max-width: 899px) {
        .glass-chart {
          width: 130px;
          padding: 10px 10px;
          top: 76%;
          left: 12px;
        }

        .glass-chart-value {
          font-size: 13px;
        }
      }

      /* Cursor Spotlight — revela a malha de pontos ao redor do mouse (ref: animacoes e efeitos.md) */
      .cursor-spotlight {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 9998;
        pointer-events: none;
        background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(151, 116, 254, 0.65) 0.8px, transparent 0.8px);
        background-size: 12px 12px;
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle 200px at var(--x, -999px) var(--y, -999px), black 0%, transparent 100%);
        mask-image: radial-gradient(circle 200px at var(--x, -999px) var(--y, -999px), black 0%, transparent 100%);
      }

      /* Sem spotlight no mobile / telas de toque */
      @media (max-width: 899px), (hover: none) {
        .cursor-spotlight {
          display: none;
        }
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .title {
          font-size: 46px;
          letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 96px;
        }

        /* Em telas largas a imagem (vertical) fica contida e centralizada */
        .hero-bg {
          background-size: contain;
          background-position: center bottom;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .reveal-ready [data-reveal] .reveal-item {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: none;
          transition: none;
        }

        .button,
        .stat-hero-value,
        .orbit-layer {
          animation: none;
        }

        .marquee-track {
          animation-play-state: paused;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="floating-header" id="floating-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="One Impact — início">
        <strong>One Impact</strong>
      </a>

      <div class="header-actions">
        <nav class="desktop-menu" aria-label="Navegação principal">
          <a href="#inicio">Início</a>
          <a href="#dados">Dados</a>
          <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
        </nav>

        <button
          class="mobile-menu-toggle"
          id="mobile-menu-toggle"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Abrir menu"
          aria-controls="mobile-menu"
          aria-expanded="false"
        >
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <nav class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu" aria-label="Navegação mobile" aria-hidden="true" inert>
        <a href="#inicio">Início</a>
        <a href="#dados">Dados</a>
        <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="hero-orbs" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="glass-orb glass-orb-1">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
            <path d="M2 12h20" />
            <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
          </svg>
        </span>

        <span class="glass-orb glass-orb-2">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z" />
          </svg>
        </span>

        <div class="glass-chart">
          <span class="glass-chart-label">Vendas</span>
          <span class="glass-chart-value">R$ 30.739 <span class="glass-chart-arrow">↑</span></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 220 96" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="chart-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7345FD" stop-opacity="0.75" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7345FD" stop-opacity="0.05" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path d="M4 82 L36 60 L68 68 L100 44 L132 52 L164 30 L196 38 L212 16 L212 92 L4 92 Z" fill="url(#chart-fill)" />
            <path d="M4 82 L36 60 L68 68 L100 44 L132 52 L164 30 L196 38 L212 16" stroke="#9774FE" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <path d="M212 16 L204 16 M212 16 L212 24" stroke="#9774FE" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cursor-spotlight" id="cursor-spotlight" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="container" data-reveal>
        <span class="badge reveal-item">Agência de posicionamento profissional</span>
        <h1 class="title reveal-item">
          Organizamos o <span class="title-highlight">caos</span> do seu digital.
        </h1>

        <p class="description reveal-item">
          Unificamos sua presença online em uma estrutura profissional que transforma visitantes em clientes.
        </p>

        <a href="#contato" class="button reveal-item">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26.576 5.363c-2.69-2.69-6.406-4.354-10.511-4.354-8.209 0-14.865 6.655-14.865 14.865 0 2.732 0.737 5.291 2.022 7.491l-0.038-0.070-2.109 7.702 7.879-2.067c2.051 1.139 4.498 1.809 7.102 1.809h0.006c8.209-0.003 14.862-6.659 14.862-14.868 0-4.103-1.662-7.817-4.349-10.507l0 0zM16.062 28.228h-0.005c-0 0-0.001 0-0.001 0-2.319 0-4.489-0.64-6.342-1.753l0.056 0.031-0.451-0.267-4.675 1.227 1.247-4.559-0.294-0.467c-1.185-1.862-1.889-4.131-1.889-6.565 0-6.822 5.531-12.353 12.353-12.353s12.353 5.531 12.353 12.353c0 6.822-5.53 12.353-12.353 12.353h-0zM22.838 18.977c-0.371-0.186-2.197-1.083-2.537-1.208-0.341-0.124-0.589-0.185-0.837 0.187-0.246 0.371-0.958 1.207-1.175 1.455-0.216 0.249-0.434 0.279-0.805 0.094-1.15-0.466-2.138-1.087-2.997-1.852l0.010 0.009c-0.799-0.74-1.484-1.587-2.037-2.521l-0.028-0.052c-0.216-0.371-0.023-0.572 0.162-0.757 0.167-0.166 0.372-0.434 0.557-0.65 0.146-0.179 0.271-0.384 0.366-0.604l0.006-0.017c0.043-0.087 0.068-0.188 0.068-0.296 0-0.131-0.037-0.253-0.101-0.357l0.002 0.003c-0.094-0.186-0.836-2.014-1.145-2.758-0.302-0.724-0.609-0.625-0.836-0.637-0.216-0.010-0.464-0.012-0.712-0.012-0.395 0.010-0.746 0.188-0.988 0.463l-0.001 0.002c-0.802 0.761-1.3 1.834-1.3 3.023 0 0.026 0 0.053 0.001 0.079l-0-0.004c0.131 1.467 0.681 2.784 1.527 3.857l-0.012-0.015c1.604 2.379 3.742 4.282 6.251 5.564l0.094 0.043c0.548 0.248 1.25 0.513 1.968 0.74l0.149 0.041c0.442 0.14 0.951 0.221 1.479 0.221 0.303 0 0.601-0.027 0.889-0.078l-0.031 0.004c1.069-0.223 1.956-0.868 2.497-1.749l0.009-0.017c0.165-0.366 0.261-0.793 0.261-1.242 0-0.185-0.016-0.366-0.047-0.542l0.003 0.019c-0.092-0.155-0.34-0.247-0.712-0.434z"/></svg>
          Solicitar proposta
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="marquee-section" aria-label="Áreas que atendemos">
      <div class="marquee-wrapper">
        <div class="marquee-track">
          {marqueeItems.map((item) => (
            <>
              <span class="marquee-item">{item}</span>
              <span class="marquee-separator" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            </>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dados-section" id="dados">
      <div class="dados-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="dados-container" data-reveal-scroll>
        <span class="badge reveal-fade">Dados</span>
        <h2 class="reveal-fade">Antes de te contratar, seu cliente te pesquisa</h2>

        <div class="dados-grid reveal-fade">
          <div class="stat-hero">
            <div class="stat-hero-value" id="stat-countup">0%</div>
            <p class="stat-hero-label">das pessoas julgam a credibilidade de um negócio pela qualidade do site.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-cols-wrap">
            <div class="stat-cols">
              <div class="stat-col">
                <div class="stat-col-track">
                  <div class="stat-col-fill" style="--val: 75%">
                    <span class="stat-col-value">75%</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="stat-col-label">Julgam a credibilidade pelo site</span>
              </div>

              <div class="stat-col">
                <div class="stat-col-track">
                  <div class="stat-col-fill" style="--val: 81%">
                    <span class="stat-col-value">81%</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="stat-col-label">Pesquisam antes de contratar</span>
              </div>

              <div class="stat-col">
                <div class="stat-col-track">
                  <div class="stat-col-fill" style="--val: 88%">
                    <span class="stat-col-value">88%</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="stat-col-label">Não voltam após experiência ruim</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="dados-fonte">Fontes: Stanford Web Credibility Research · GE Capital · Google</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section" id="importancia">
      <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cta-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="container" data-reveal-scroll>
        <span class="badge reveal-fade">Por que isso importa</span>
        <h2 class="title reveal-fade">
          Uma presença amadora está te <span class="title-highlight">custando clientes</span>.
        </h2>

        <div class="cta-cards reveal-fade">
          <article class="cta-card">
            <span class="cta-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><path d="M12 6v6l4 2" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Você tem segundos</h3>
            <p>O visitante decide em segundos se confia em você. Site amador é aba fechada — e cliente perdido sem você nem saber.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cta-card">
            <span class="cta-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8" /><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Seu cliente te pesquisa</h3>
            <p>Antes de chamar no WhatsApp, ele olha seu site e suas redes. Se parecer feito de qualquer jeito, ele chama o concorrente.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cta-card">
            <span class="cta-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 1v22" /><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Amador compete por preço</h3>
            <p>Quem parece profissional cobra pelo seu valor. Quem parece amador entra no leilão de orçamento — e ganha quem cobra menos.</p>
          </article>
